# Bridge to Spring

Keep the JRebirth client clean while consuming Spring-side services or APIs.

## Rules

- the UI layer never manipulates JPA entities.
- network and backend calls stay in a dedicated Service or gateway.
- DTOs stay plain.
- FXO stays client-side only.
- map DTO and FXO cleanly across the boundary.
